        <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> may </STYLE>
        <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> profit </STYLE> the <gr str="1121">son </gr>of <gr str="120">man</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="9"> By reason of the <gr str="4480 7230">multitude </gr>of <gr str="6217">oppressions </gr>they make <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> the </STYLE>
        <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> oppressed </STYLE> to <gr str="2199">cry</gr>: they cry <gr str="7768">out </gr>by reason of the <gr str="4480 2220">arm </gr>of the <gr str="7227">mighty</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="10"> But <gr str="3808">none </gr>
        <gr str="559">saith</gr>, <gr str="346">Where </gr>
